  "description": "LiveMarkdown.Avalonia is a High-performance Markdown viewer for Avalonia applications.\n      It supports real-time rendering of Markdown content, so it's ideal for applications that require dynamic text updating, especially when streaming LLM outputs.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
